    "/tools/compare_images": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Compare a before and after image and return a similarity score, changed pixel counts, and deterministic changed regions.\n\nWhen to use:\n- Screenshot regression checks and before/after change detection.\n- Deciding whether anything changed before inspecting an image visually.\n- Locating the regions that changed so a later crop can be targeted.\n\nWhen not to use:\n- Explain or describe why something changed, or judge visual quality.\n- Comparing images that are not pixel comparable, such as different renderings of unrelated content.\n\nInput constraints:\n- Images are referenced only as {'kind':'local_path','path':...} inside the configured allowed roots or {'kind':'asset','assetId':...}; base64, data URLs, remote URLs, storage URLs, and SAS URLs are rejected.\n- threshold is 0.0-1.0 as a fraction of the channel range; maxRegions is 1-100.\n- Unequal sizes compare the overlapping region and count the remainder as changed.\n\nBehaviour: Fully deterministic and local: no model or network call is involved and repeated calls on the same inputs return identical output.\nToken savings: Replaces sending two full images to native vision with a small numeric summary and at most a few region boxes.",
        "operationId": "compare_images",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CompareImagesInput"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CompareImagesOutput"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Compare two images",
        "tags": [
          "vision tools"
