    "/tools/optimize_image_region": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Crop a known pixel region, optionally downscale it, and store the compressed result as an opaque artifact.\n\nWhen to use:\n- You already know the coordinates worth inspecting, for example from compare_images or extract_text_and_layout.\n- You must send a small, cheap crop to native vision instead of a full screenshot.\n\nWhen not to use:\n- You do not know which region matters yet; find it first.\n- You want to find where a control such as a login button is on screen; locating elements is not supported.\n- You need the text itself, which extract_text_and_layout returns directly.\n\nInput constraints:\n- Images are referenced only as {'kind':'local_path','path':...} inside the configured allowed roots or {'kind':'asset','assetId':...}; base64, data URLs, remote URLs, storage URLs, and SAS URLs are rejected.\n- box is pixels with a top-left origin: x and y are the inclusive left and top edges.\n- The box must lie inside the image; it is rejected rather than clamped. maxWidth and maxHeight are 16-8192, quality is 1-100, and outputFormat is png, jpeg, or webp.\n\nBehaviour: Fully deterministic and local: crops never upscale and resizing uses a fixed Lanczos filter.\nToken savings: A cropped, downscaled artifact costs a fraction of the image tokens of the original screenshot.",
        "operationId": "optimize_image_region",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OptimizeRegionInput"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OptimizeRegionOutput"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Crop and optimize an image region",
        "tags": [
          "vision tools"
